    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d362">

                <pb facs="0465" n="455" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg455"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894A.001/4–2347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-04-23">April 23,
                        1947</date>.<lb/>[Received April 23—6:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>880. Minister Peng Hsueh-pei, at regular MOI<anchor n="27" xml:id="d362-f1"/>
                    press conference on April 23, answered following questions re Taiwan situation:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Query: When will Dr. Wei Tao-ming<anchor n="28" xml:id="d362-f2"/>
                            assume the governorship of Taiwan. Minister Peng’s answer: No date has
                            been chosen yet but Dr. Wei will proceed to his new post in a few
                            days.</p>
                        <p>Query: When will other recommendations of General Pai Chunghsi be carried
                            out. Minister Peng’s answer: General Pai’s other recommendations will be
                            put into execution one by one following the arrival of the new governor
                            in Taiwan.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
